{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  CRO-12526 (v2) — new top layout (breadcrumb/meta row, gallery,
  buy-first buy box). Everything above this comment is verbatim from
  sections/main-product_crp.liquid (warranty/banner assigns,
  <product-info> open, asset loads, tab-content captures, MOQ logic);
  everything below the "Tab Section" marker further down is verbatim
  again. Only this middle region is new markup.

  Wiring contract with the control theme (all verified, none edited):
  - <product-info> (opened above, verbatim) + product-info.js drive
    option changes: they fetch this section's own render and swap
    #price-{{ section.id }}, toggle the submit button, and publish
    PUB_SUB_EVENTS.variantChange (payload .data.variant) on the global
    pubsub loaded by theme.liquid. cro-12526-v2-pdp.js subscribes to
    that event for the freight tier + SKU/readout refresh.
  - The REAL Add to Cart / Add to Quote / Back-Order buttons are
    buy-buttons_crp.liquid rendered inside [data-cro12526v2-realbuttons]
    (visually collapsed, still in the DOM). The visible buttons below
    only forward .click() onto them, so cart-drawer opening, the
    localStorage minicart-payement-option pre-select ('pay-online' /
    'request-quote'), MOQ handling and back-order behaviour all keep
    working unmodified.
  - The change-location pop-up is theme.liquid's global
    #PopupModal-modal_change_location — opened with the same
    modal-opener element the control snippet uses.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

