{%- liquid
  assign product_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: section.id

  assign title_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'title' | first
  assign price_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'price' | first
  assign variant_picker_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'variant_picker' | first
  assign qty_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'quantity_selector' | first
  assign buy_buttons_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'buy_buttons' | first

  comment
    Delivery days — same vendor rule as the control
    (product-shipping-and-returns.liquid / crp fulfilment list).
  endcomment
  assign crp_deliverdays = 0
  assign crp_vendor = product.vendor | handleize
  if crp_vendor == 'jasonl'
    assign crp_deliverdays = settings.delivery_days_jasonl | times: 1
  else
    assign crp_deliverdays = settings.delivery_days_suppliers | times: 1
  endif

  comment
    Back-order estimated availability date — verbatim precedence from the
    control: product-level productmeta.custom_availability_date when it is
    in the future, else the shop-level custom_fields.availability_date.
  endcomment
  assign crp_today_ts = 'now' | date: '%s'
  assign crp_avail_ts = product.metafields.productmeta.custom_availability_date | date: '%s'
  if product.metafields.productmeta.custom_availability_date != blank and crp_avail_ts > crp_today_ts
    assign crp_backorder_date = product.metafields.productmeta.custom_availability_date | date: '%a, %d %b, %Y'
  else
    assign crp_backorder_date = shop.metafields.custom_fields.availability_date | date: '%a, %d %b, %Y'
  endif

  comment
    Freight tier from the current variant price (server-side initial
    render; cro-12526-v2-pdp.js re-renders on variantChange). Bands per
    spec: <=$1,000 -> $49, <=$2,000 -> $149, <=$10,000 -> $199,
    above -> no "from" amount. Prices are in cents.
  endcomment
  assign cro12526v2_price = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price
  assign cro12526v2_freight = ''
  if cro12526v2_price <= 100000
    assign cro12526v2_freight = '$49'
  elsif cro12526v2_price <= 200000
    assign cro12526v2_freight = '$149'
  elsif cro12526v2_price <= 1000000
    assign cro12526v2_freight = '$199'
  endif

  comment
    Static reviews (QA round 1, point 2): merchant-editable via theme
    editor settings (rating value + count text + on/off), so the client
    can update or hide them until a real review source is confirmed.
  endcomment
  assign cro12526v2_rating_val = section.settings.cro12526v2_reviews_rating | strip | plus: 0.0
  assign cro12526v2_rating_pct = cro12526v2_rating_val | times: 20.0
  if cro12526v2_rating_pct > 100
    assign cro12526v2_rating_pct = 100
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Control-parity body class (QA round 1, point 3): the live control is the
  UNSUFFIXED product template, whose body gets `product-template` from
  body-classes.liquid. perth.js only reloads the page after a region change
  (which is what refreshes the "Get it by" date on control) when that class
  is present — suffixed templates like this one never get it, so add it.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script>
  document.body.classList.add('product-template');
</script>

<div class="page-width" id="product-detail-top">

  {%- render 'cro-12526-v2-breadcrumb-meta', context: 'desktop' -%}

  <div class="cro12526v2-layout">

    {%- comment -%} ---------- Gallery column ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="cro12526v2-layout__gallery">
      <h2 class="cro12526v2-title cro12526v2-title--mobile">{{ product.title | escape }}</h2>
      {%- render 'cro-12526-v2-gallery' -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ---------- Buy box column ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="cro12526v2-layout__buybox cro12526v2-buybox{% if section.settings.cro12526v2_small_title %} cro12526v2-buybox--small-title{% endif %}{% if section.settings.cro12526v2_small_swatches %} cro12526v2-buybox--small-swatches{% endif %}">

      {%- comment -%}
        Round 17 (2026-08-25): title + rating + price grouped in one wrapper so
        the desktop gaps can match Figma "Frame 26" (gap 10 between the three)
        while the buy box keeps its 20px rhythm below. Client Round 2A —
        "CTAs above the fold": spacing matched to Figma first; the two optional
        levers (smaller title / 50px swatches) are theme-editor toggles.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cro12526v2-buybox__head">
      <h1 class="cro12526v2-title cro12526v2-title--desktop" {% if title_block %}{{ title_block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}>
        {{ product.title | escape }}
      </h1>

      {%- comment -%}
        Static reviews — editable in the theme editor (section settings:
        enable / rating / count text). Real review data source is still a
        pending client action point; when it lands, swap these settings
        for the live source.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.cro12526v2_reviews_enable and cro12526v2_rating_val > 0 -%}
        <div class="cro12526v2-rating">
          <span class="cro12526v2-rating__stars" role="img" aria-label="{{ cro12526v2_rating_val }} out of 5 stars" style="--cro12526v2-rating: {{ cro12526v2_rating_pct }}%;">
            <span class="cro12526v2-rating__stars-fill" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cro12526v2-rating__text">
            {{ section.settings.cro12526v2_reviews_rating }}{% if section.settings.cro12526v2_reviews_count != blank %} &middot; {{ section.settings.cro12526v2_reviews_count }}{% endif %}
          </span>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="cro12526v2-price" {% if price_block %}{{ price_block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}>
        <div class="cro12526v2-price__row">
          <div class="cro12526v2-price__amount" id="price-{{ section.id }}" role="status">
            {%- render 'price', product: product, use_variant: true, show_badges: false, price_class: '' -%}
          </div>
          <span class="cro12526v2-price__gst">incl. GST</span>
        </div>
        <p class="cro12526v2-price__note">Configured price updates as you choose options below.</p>
      </div>
      </div>{%- comment -%} /cro12526v2-buybox__head {%- endcomment -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        ---------- Options: size (sibling products) + Shopify options ----------
        id="options_container" is REQUIRED (QA round 1): two of the control's
        inline scripts (the option-image preloader in
        product-media-gallery-custom.liquid and the Tippy addon-tooltip
        re-initialiser in the verbatim tail below) observe this exact id with
        a MutationObserver and throw on page load when it is missing.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cro12526v2-options" id="options_container">
        {%- render 'cro-12526-v2-options', product: product, block: variant_picker_block, product_form_id: product_form_id -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ---------- Purchase details: delivery date / location / freight ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cro12526v2-details">
        {%- if product.available -%}
          {%- unless product.tags contains 'contact-to-purchase' -%}
            <p class="cro12526v2-details__line cro12526v2-details__line--instock">
              <span class="cro12526v2-details__bullet">&middot;</span>
              Get it by
              <strong data-cro12526v2-delivery-date data-delivery-days="{{ crp_deliverdays }}">&hellip;</strong>
              <span class="cro12526v2-details__location-wrap">&mdash; to <strong data-cro12526v2-location>Australia</strong></span>
              <modal-opener class="cro12526v2-details__change no-js-hidden" data-modal="#PopupModal-modal_change_location">
                <button type="button" class="cro12526v2-details__change-btn">(&nbsp;change&nbsp;)</button>
              </modal-opener>
            </p>
          {%- endunless -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if crp_backorder_date != blank -%}
          <p class="cro12526v2-details__line cro12526v2-details__line--backorder">
            <span class="cro12526v2-details__bullet">&middot;</span>
            Estimated availability date: <strong>{{ crp_backorder_date }}</strong>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p class="cro12526v2-details__line" data-cro12526v2-freight>
          <span class="cro12526v2-details__bullet">&middot;</span>
          {%- if cro12526v2_freight != '' -%}
            <strong>Freight from {{ cro12526v2_freight }}</strong> &mdash; calculated at checkout.
          {%- else -%}
            Freight calculated at checkout.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ---------- Actions: quantity + Add to Cart, Add to Quote / Back-Order ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cro12526v2-actions">
        <div class="cro12526v2-actions__row">
          <div
            id="Quantity-Form-{{ section.id }}"
            class="cro12526v2-qty product-form__input product-form__quantity"
            {% if qty_block %}{{ qty_block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}
          >
            {% # theme-check-disable %}
            {%- assign cart_qty = cart | item_count_for_variant: product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id -%}
            {% # theme-check-enable %}
            {%- comment -%}
              Control's exact label markup (QA round 1, ATC/ATQ fix): the
              .quantity__rules-cart span + loading spinner MUST exist —
              product-info.js's fetchQuantityRules() (subscribed to the
              cartUpdate event that product-form.js publishes right before
              opening the cart drawer) calls
              querySelector('.quantity__rules-cart .loading__spinner')
              unguarded. Without this span that call throws and the drawer
              never opens after add-to-cart / add-to-quote.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <label class="quantity__label form__label" for="Quantity-{{ section.id }}">
              <span class="quantity__rules-cart{% if cart_qty == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}">
                {%- render 'loading-spinner' -%}
                <span
                  >(
                  {{- 'products.product.quantity.in_cart_html' | t: quantity: cart_qty -}}
                  )</span
                >
              </span>
            </label>
            <quantity-input class="quantity" data-url="{{ product.url }}" data-section="{{ section.id }}">
              <button class="quantity__button" name="minus" type="button">
                <span class="visually-hidden">Decrease quantity for {{ product.title | escape }}</span>
                <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-minus.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
              </button>
              <input
                class="quantity__input"
                type="number"
                name="quantity"
                id="Quantity-{{ section.id }}"
                data-cart-quantity="{{ cart_qty }}"
                data-min="{{ min_order_qty }}"
                min="{{ min_order_qty }}"
                step="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.quantity_rule.increment }}"
                value="{{ min_order_qty }}"
                form="{{ product_form_id }}"
              >
              <button class="quantity__button" name="plus" type="button">
                <span class="visually-hidden">Increase quantity for {{ product.title | escape }}</span>
                <span class="svg-wrapper">{{- 'icon-plus.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}</span>
              </button>
            </quantity-input>
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            class="cro12526v2-btn cro12526v2-btn--cart"
            data-cro12526v2-add-to-cart
            {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available == false or product.selected_or_first_available_variant == null %}disabled{% endif %}
          >
            <svg class="cro12526v2-btn__icon" width="20" height="21" viewBox="0 0 20 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M1 1.5H4L6.68 13.89C6.77144 14.3504 7.02191 14.764 7.38755 15.0583C7.75318 15.3526 8.2107 15.509 8.68 15.5H16.4C16.8693 15.509 17.3268 15.3526 17.6925 15.0583C18.0581 14.764 18.3086 14.3504 18.4 13.89L20 5.5H5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="scale(0.92)"/>
              <circle cx="8.5" cy="19" r="1.3" fill="currentColor"/>
